how","id":"194961","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[21]}],"link":"22739","synopsis":"Kyosuke meets with Ruri and tells her he loves someone else. The next day, Kyosuke asks Kirino out on a Christmas date to Akihabara like they did a year previously. Kyosuke reveals that he had finally fallen in love with a girl, which upsets Kirino and causes her to run off. Giving chase, Kyosuke quickly looses sight of Kirino when at that moment Kaori, Saori and Ruri show up in a minivan. After spotting Kirino, Kyosuke jumps out of the van and corners her. Not denying his feelings any longer, Kyosuke publicly acknowledges his love for Kirino. Kyosuke then asks her to stay in Japan and marry him. Kirino tearfully accepts.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gkjHGyQntpF9x5nQmGISIp41P92.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 21","synopsis":"Kyosuke meets with Ruri and tells her he loves someone else. The next day, Kyosuke asks Kirino out on a Christmas date to Akihabara like they did a year previously. Kyosuke reveals that he had finally fallen in love with a girl, which upsets Kirino and causes her to run off. Giving chase, Kyosuke quickly looses sight of Kirino when at that moment Kaori, Saori and Ruri show up in a minivan. After spotting Kirino, Kyosuke jumps out of the van and corners her. Not denying his feelings any longer, Kyosuke publicly acknowledges his love for Kirino. Kyosuke then asks her to stay in Japan and marry him. Kirino tearfully accepts.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/gkjHGyQntpF9x5nQmGISIp41P92.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 22","episodeNumber":2,"sourceEpisodeNumber":2,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"18857","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"mal","id":"18857","episodeNumbers":[2]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"56353","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[22]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"194961","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[22]}],"link":"22737","synopsis":"Kyosuke gives Kirino a Christmas present which turns out to be the same ring she had asked him for the year previously. Kirino reveals that she had planned on confessing to Kyosuke herself. Kirino whispers to Kyosuke an idea for handling their relationship. Time passes and the siblings formally announce their relationship to Saori and Ruri. Later, Kanako confesses her love for Kyosuke which he rejects. The next morning, Kyosuke surprisingly wakes up with Kirino in his bed. Kirino reveals a photo album containing the memories they shared together while growing up. Kirino and Kyosuke listen to the diaries she had been recording since she was young.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ps6tQB23n3Czi76bUE3CQvGlUHS.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 22","synopsis":"Kyosuke gives Kirino a Christmas present which turns out to be the same ring she had asked him for the year previously. Kirino reveals that she had planned on confessing to Kyosuke herself. Kirino whispers to Kyosuke an idea for handling their relationship. Time passes and the siblings formally announce their relationship to Saori and Ruri. Later, Kanako confesses her love for Kyosuke which he rejects. The next morning, Kyosuke surprisingly wakes up with Kirino in his bed. Kirino reveals a photo album containing the memories they shared together while growing up. Kirino and Kyosuke listen to the diaries she had been recording since she was young.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/ps6tQB23n3Czi76bUE3CQvGlUHS.jpg","titleLanguage":"it-IT","synopsisLanguage":"en-US"}}},{"title":"Episodio 23","episodeNumber":3,"sourceEpisodeNumber":3,"seasonNumber":0,"externalMappings":[{"provider":"anilist","id":"18857","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"mal","id":"18857","episodeNumbers":[3]},{"provider":"tmdb_show","id":"56353","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[23]},{"provider":"tvdb_show","id":"194961","scope":"s0","seasonNumber":0,"episodeNumbers":[23]}],"link":"22738","synopsis":"Kyosuke and Manami graduate from high school. After the graduation ceremony, Kirino arrives to pick Kyosuke up following the end of her middle school graduation, and both head out to meet Manami. In a park, Manami scolds them about their relationship. Manami and Kirino then get into a fist fight. Manami scolds them some more and then confesses her love for Kyosuke. Manami then punches Kyosuke and accepts his rejection. Later on, Kirino and Kyosuke have a pseudo-marriage at the church. They kiss, and then Kirino gives Kyosuke back the ring she was given before. It's revealed that Kirino's idea for their relationship was to be a couple until graduation and then go back to being normal siblings. In the epilogue Kyosuke and Kirino head to Akihabara for a meet-up with Saori and a new member. Kyosuke casually kisses Kirino on her cheek, much to her disgust.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eTMzNBrQ20ThmRolOh9F4cCUCnI.jpg","metadataSources":{"tmdb":{"title":"Episodio 23","synopsis":"Kyosuke and Manami graduate from high school. After the graduation ceremony, Kirino arrives to pick Kyosuke up following the end of her middle school graduation, and both head out to meet Manami. In a park, Manami scolds them about their relationship. Manami and Kirino then get into a fist fight. Manami scolds them some more and then confesses her love for Kyosuke. Manami then punches Kyosuke and accepts his rejection. Later on, Kirino and Kyosuke have a pseudo-marriage at the church. They kiss, and then Kirino gives Kyosuke back the ring she was given before. It's revealed that Kirino's idea for their relationship was to be a couple until graduation and then go back to being normal siblings. In the epilogue Kyosuke and Kirino head to Akihabara for a meet-up with Saori and a new member. Kyosuke casually kisses Kirino on her cheek, much to her disgust.","thumbnail":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w300/eTMzNBrQ20ThmRolOh9F4cCUCnI.